<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Commande livrée - Merci !</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F9FAFB;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #F9FAFB;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 0;">
            <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
                <!-- Header -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16C669 0%, #12A855 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center;">
                        <span style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff;">RECYCLUM</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Body -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <!-- Icon -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 20px;">
                                    <span style="font-size: 64px; line-height: 1;">&#127881;</span>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Title -->
                        <h1 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #1F2937; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Commande livrée !</h1>
                        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #6B7280; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 30px 0;">Votre appareil reconditionné est maintenant chez vous</p>

                        <!-- Thank You Box -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.15) 0%, rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.05) 100%); border: 2px solid rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.4); border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                                    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 22px; color: #065F46;">Merci {{ order.deliveryFirstName }} ! &#128154;</h2>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #047857; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;">
                                        En choisissant un appareil reconditionné chez Recyclum, vous avez fait un geste concret pour la planète.
                                        Nous sommes fiers de vous compter parmi notre communauté de consommateurs responsables.
                                    </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Order Info -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border: 2px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Commande</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;">{{ order.orderNumber }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Date de livraison</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;">{{ order.deliveredAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Statut</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;">
                                                <span style="display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16C669 0%, #12A855 100%); color: white; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;">&#10003; Livrée</span>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Eco Impact -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F0FDF4; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 25px; text-align: center;">
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 18px; color: #166534;">&#127757; Votre impact écologique</h3>
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="text-align: center; padding: 10px;">
                                                <span style="display: block; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #16C669;">-70%</span>
                                                <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #4B5563;">d'émissions CO2</span>
                                            </td>
                                            <td style="text-align: center; padding: 10px;">
                                                <span style="display: block; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #16C669;">-80%</span>
                                                <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #4B5563;">de ressources</span>
                                            </td>
                                            <td style="text-align: center; padding: 10px;">
                                                <span style="display: block; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #16C669;">1</span>
                                                <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #4B5563;">appareil sauvé</span>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Warranty Box -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #EFF6FF; border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #1E40AF; font-size: 16px;">&#128737; Votre garantie Recyclum</h4>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #1E3A8A; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                                        Votre appareil est couvert par notre garantie. En cas de problème technique,
                                        notre équipe est là pour vous accompagner. Conservez bien votre numéro de commande
                                        <strong>{{ order.orderNumber }}</strong> pour toute demande de SAV.
                                    </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Products Recap -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border: 2px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1F2937;">&#128230; Récapitulatif de votre commande</h3>
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        {% for item in order.items %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 12px 0; {% if not loop.last %}border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;{% endif %}">
                                                <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2937;">{{ item.productTitle }}</p>
                                                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6B7280;">{{ item.productBrand }} - Qté: {{ item.quantity }}</p>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        {% endfor %}
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Support Box -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border-radius: 12px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 25px; text-align: center;">
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1F2937;">Une question sur votre appareil ?</h3>
                                    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;">Notre équipe est disponible pour vous aider avec l'installation, l'utilisation ou toute autre question.</p>
                                    <a href="mailto:contact@recyclum.com" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 30px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16C669 0%, #12A855 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px;">Nous contacter</a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Footer -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="background: #1F2937; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #ffffff;">Merci de faire confiance à Recyclum !</p>
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #ffffff;">Parlez de nous autour de vous et aidez-nous à réduire les déchets électroniques &#127793;</p>
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">&copy; {{ "now"|date('Y') }} Recyclum - Electroménager reconditionné</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
